              "maximum": 1.0,
              "minimum": 0.0,
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "description": "1 - ok / attempted, computed with that expression and never rounded. Required, and null iff attempted == 0. When attempted > 0 it must equal 1 - ok / attempted within an absolute 1e-12 (D7, v0.5 AQ7 and v0.6 FQ3; enforced by the model).",
